'''bebeast†''' (bẹ̄-bēst′), ''v. t.'' [< ''be-''<sup>1</sup> + ''beast''.] To make a beast of; consider as a beast; treat as a beast.

'''bebeeric''' (bẹ̄-bē′rik), ''a.'' [< ''bebeeru'' + ''-ic''.] Of or derived from bebeerin. Also written ''bebiric''. {{smaller|—'''Bebeeric acid''', a white, crystalline, volatile acid extracted from the seeds of ''Nectandra Rodiæi''.}}

